<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Small</ansi> mutation

Your body compacts, shedding mass for agility. You become a difficult
target — quick and nimble, though your strikes carry less weight.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Very Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Improved dodge — your compact frame is genuinely difficult to hit
  cleanly
  Moderately improved dexterity from the lighter, more agile frame

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Moderately reduced maximum health — a smaller body has less
  margin to absorb punishment
  Slightly reduced combat damage — your lighter frame hits with
  less force

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Large

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
